<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TCF Financial said started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TCF Financial said started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney started coverage of TCF Financial Corp with an outperform rating, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 39-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
